{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Iria: Zeiram The Animation","Iria is the story of a girl and the Alien being she loves to hate. The series begins with her brother, Gren, taking a job. He is a bounty hunter, and one well known for his incredible skill. Iria, being a skilled apprentice bounty hunter herself, tags along. What is the job, one might ask. It is to find out what has happened to the crew and cargo of a Space Station. Needless to say, nothing is as it seems, and the war between Iria and Zeiram begins in earnest."],"ja":["I・Я・I・A ZЁIЯAM THE ANIMATION",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-432","ids":{"shikimori":432,"mal":432,"anilist":432,"kodik":"serial-21631"},"kodikIds":["serial-5968","serial-21631"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-5968":"2019-12-18T01:34:32Z","serial-21631":"2020-01-22T21:00:19Z"},"title":"Ирия: Зейрам","originalTitle":"Iria Zeiram The Animation","alt":"Ирия - Зейрам OVA Iria: Zeiram The Animation I・Я・I・A ZЁIЯAM THE ANIMATION","description":"Зейрам — самая опасная форма жизни в галактике. Это существо неуязвимо, одолеть его практически невозможно. В ходе выполнения миссии по спасению экипажа и груза космического корабля от неизвестной угрозы команда охотников за головами, в состав которой входят Ирия, Боб и Глен, сталкиваются с серьёзной проблемой. Оказывается, что груз, который они должны были защищать, — это Зейрам.","year":1993,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Фантастика","космос"],"rating":7.1,"popularity":9742,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/432/ac0b594402664c5c3e184f1c41ecb43e.jpeg","width":695,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n432-NmmzCtPk7uwh.jpg","width":854,"height":290}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-757","dubId":"757","label":"MC Entertainment","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null